- Facilitate communication between developers, project managers, and stakeholders.
- Support project management activities, including documentation review and schedule management.
- Use Jira for issue tracking and project coordination.
- Conduct requirements analysis to ensure project specifications are met.
- Support technical communication, bridging gaps between technical and non-technical teams.
- Monitor project progress and report key metrics to stakeholders.
- Provide mentorship and guidance to junior team members when necessary.
- Maintain a solid understanding of APIs and database structures relevant to assigned projects.', '- Minimum of 1 years of experience in project coordination or project management.- At least 2 years of experience working as a Korean Interpreter / Assistant.- Proficiency in Korean, TOPIK level 6 or above.- Ability to support PM-level schedule planning and management.- Ability to review and understand database structures, including table relationships and basic schema logic.- Excellent verbal and written communication skills in Vietnamese and Korean.- Proactive, self-motivated, and highly responsible.- Experience working with ERP and CRM systems is highly preferred.- Strong understanding of business processes and requirements analysis.- Proficiency in technical communication and documentation.- Familiarity with project management tools, especially Jira.- Ability to manage schedules and track issues effectively.- Basic understanding of APIs and database concepts.- Proficiency in English is a plus.- Strong problem-solving mindset and commitment to project alignment.', '- Participation in Social Insurance, Health Insurance, and Unemployment Insurance in accordance with Vietnamese labor laws.
- Free snack bar, including snacks, tea, beverages, and coffee available at the office.
- Participation in company team-building activities and internal events organized periodically according to company policies.
- Professional and dynamic working environment with opportunities to work directly with Korean partners and stakeholders.
- Opportunities to enhance skills in project management, ERP/CRM systems, and cross-cultural communication.', 'Trụ sở chính công ty', 903, NULL, 1);
